    <item>
      <title>雷蛇推出 Mako 灰鲭鲨音箱系统：2.1 配置，到手价 1199 元</title>
      <description>&lt;p data-vmark="a03c"&gt;IT之家 9 月 23 日消息，Razer（雷蛇）昨晚发布了 Mako（灰鲭鲨）2.1 游戏音箱系统。这一套装由 2 个 2.75" 全频驱动单元和 1 个 3.5" 前置低音炮组成，&lt;strong&gt;支持 40W RMS 功率和 60W 峰值功率&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: center;" data-vmark="f787"&gt;&lt;img src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/b6eefeb0-3ea1-46c9-b997-7513de357b83.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" w="1440" h="810" data-weibo="0" data-vmark="73cf" class="no-alt-img"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-vmark="b715"&gt;Mako 音箱支持三模连接，左右两个单元采用 40° 倾角设计，&lt;strong&gt;集成背投式幻彩灯效&lt;/strong&gt;。其支持虚拟 7.1 环绕声技术，可在桌面上塑造成拟真的 3D 声场，带来细腻的听感。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-vmark="67ee"&gt;雷蛇灰鲭鲨游戏音箱&lt;strong&gt;到手价 1199 元&lt;/strong&gt;，10 月 22 日 10:00 开售。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;dir&gt;&lt;a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=yYgjGzyYsSmlhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOUV9IBA4kmjLt03G4jjYvhU7ZmnUow1rv%2BuEy53O777hDXG73T40Ebgirr1MKED%2Fa1XYgrjjXPQ%2B0kC8NFBpFt8k7BbPIUYUjAyPS51dkcczj%2F4sdtHZ%2BsKreaf5xQjjSXKh%2FVZv3j%2Bbh1s25f8J3MUSFeXo5GTdjvZdyPvH0jFsIYt%2FUDzGQuqI2UqExBRSrmQebDsS0r%2FMZN%2FPqfiSWXRGBe%2FNDtWfs5uPHiiJS9bYAAgNyXy0xGiugqt2is%2FVLUdf7S956KROucncAAt5shdVbrKqp4Yn8g%3D%3D&amp;amp;traceId=215042ce17901719228032596e0c44&amp;amp;&amp;amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1790171922@216606b9_14ec_1a0ce8fc1b3_c960@01" target="_blank" data-wapurl="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=PaAd12rcQWSlhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOUV9IBA4kmjLCh2kfNgCY%2Ba%2Bv7xTLqM%2BY4CGtkjQ8OTYZvgRaXABXRoirr1MKED%2Fa1XYgrjjXPQ%2B0kC8NFBpFt8k7BbPIUYUjDCxKrLF7ntYWYMn24TtOI2reaf5xQjjSXKh%2FVZv3j%2Bbh1s25f8J3MUSFeXo5GTdjuUuZsb6u4E1X1ON2ekjrhJJo28uvDek1Xoxa7Z5dBiq5%2Fy2CR2JzChGBe%2FNDtWfs5uPHiiJS9bYAAgNyXy0xGiugqt2is%2FVLUdf7S956KROucncAAt5shdVbrKqp4Yn8g%3D%3D&amp;amp;traceId=215045a417901719232667169e0c28&amp;amp;&amp;amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1790171923@216606b9_14ec_1a0ce8fc38e_c975@01" data-iosurl="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=Pkye2u7DqmqlhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrk